sequenceDiagram
    participant User as User Python Code
    participant TC as TrainerClient
    participant OC as OptimizerClient
    participant SC as SparkClient
    participant MRC as ModelRegistryClient
    participant K8sAPI as Kubernetes API Server<br/>443/TCP HTTPS TLS 1.2+
    participant TrainerOp as Trainer Operator
    participant KatibCtrl as Katib Controller
    participant SparkOp as Spark Operator
    participant JobSet as JobSet Controller
    participant TrainPod as Training Pod(s)
    participant MetricsSrv as Metrics Server<br/>28080/TCP HTTP
    participant SparkSvc as SparkConnect Service<br/>15002/TCP gRPC
    participant MRServer as Model Registry Server<br/>443 or 8080/TCP
    participant S3 as S3 Storage<br/>443/TCP HTTPS
    participant HF as HuggingFace Hub<br/>443/TCP HTTPS

    rect rgb(230, 240, 255)
        Note over User,TrainPod: Flow 1: Training Job Submission (Kubernetes Backend)
        User->>TC: train(trainer=..., dataset=...)
        TC->>K8sAPI: POST TrainJob CR<br/>Bearer Token
        K8sAPI->>TrainerOp: Watch event (TrainJob)
        TrainerOp->>K8sAPI: Create JobSet CR
        K8sAPI->>JobSet: Watch event (JobSet)
        JobSet->>TrainPod: Schedule Pod(s)
    end

    rect rgb(255, 240, 230)
        Note over User,TrainPod: Flow 2: Hyperparameter Optimization
        User->>OC: optimize(trainer=..., objective=...)
        OC->>K8sAPI: POST Experiment CR<br/>Bearer Token
        K8sAPI->>KatibCtrl: Watch event (Experiment)
        KatibCtrl->>K8sAPI: Create Trial CRs (TrainJobs)
        K8sAPI->>TrainerOp: Watch event (Trial TrainJobs)
        TrainerOp->>TrainPod: Schedule trial pods
    end

    rect rgb(230, 255, 240)
        Note over User,SparkSvc: Flow 3: Spark Connect Session
        User->>SC: connect(spark_conf=...)
        SC->>K8sAPI: POST SparkConnect CR<br/>Bearer Token
        K8sAPI->>SparkOp: Watch event (SparkConnect)
        SparkOp->>SparkSvc: Create SparkConnect Pod + Service<br/>15002/TCP
        User->>SparkSvc: PySpark gRPC session<br/>15002/TCP (no encryption)
    end

    rect rgb(255, 245, 230)
        Note over User,MRServer: Flow 4: Model Registration
        User->>MRC: register_model(name=..., version=...)
        MRC->>MRServer: REST API call<br/>HTTPS or HTTP<br/>Bearer Token (user_token)
        MRServer-->>MRC: Model metadata response
    end

    rect rgb(252, 228, 236)
        Note over User,S3: Flow 5: RHAI TransformersTrainer with Progress Tracking
        User->>TC: train(trainer=TransformersTrainer)
        TC->>K8sAPI: POST TrainJob CR<br/>w/ progression annotations<br/>Bearer Token
        K8sAPI->>TrainerOp: Watch event (TrainJob)
        TrainerOp->>TrainPod: Schedule training pod
        TrainPod->>MetricsSrv: Expose metrics<br/>28080/TCP HTTP
        TrainerOp->>MetricsSrv: Poll progress<br/>28080/TCP HTTP
        TrainPod->>S3: Upload checkpoints<br/>443/TCP HTTPS<br/>AWS credentials
        TrainPod->>HF: Download model/dataset<br/>443/TCP HTTPS<br/>Bearer Token
    end
